# Walkthrough - Admin Network Map Refinement

Aapke request ke mutabik humne admin panel map view ko refine kiya hai:
1. **Removed Bus & Stop Circles**: Map se active buses (green/red circles) aur geocoded stops (grey circles) ke markers ko poori tarah remove kar diya hai, jisse focus sirf routes par hi rahe.
2. **Dynamic Zoom-Gated Route Names**: Jab aap map ko zoom-in (zoom >= 10) karenge, toh automatic saare routes ke names permanently unke centroid par as a custom badge show hone lagenge. Zoom-out (zoom < 10) karne par badges hide ho jayenge aur normal hover (sticky tooltip) behavior reactivate ho jayega.
3. **Custom Sleek Tooltips**: Map tooltips ko modern dark theme ke sath align kiya hai. Default Leaflet border, white background, aur arrows ko bypass karke ek elegant dark-themed glassmorphism tooltip design kiya hai.

